			<p style=3D"margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:3pt; text-align:center; font-=
size:26pt">
				<span style=3D"font-weight:bold">Harbor Lane news - November 2026</span>
			</p>
			<h1 style=3D"margin-top:10pt; margin-bottom:3pt; page-break-after:avoid;=
 font-size:15pt">
				<span style=3D"color:#1f3a5f">North Pier opens on 1 December</span>
			</h1>
			<p style=3D"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:6pt">
				<img src=3D"image.002.jpeg" width=3D"640" height=3D"400" alt=3D"" />
			</p>
			<p style=3D"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:6pt">
				<span>Our second warehouse, the North Pier distribution centre, ships i=
ts first orders on 1 December. If you are north of the harbour, your delive=
ries arrive up to a day earlier, and chilled goods travel in our new cold c=
hain.</span>
			</p>
			<h1 style=3D"margin-top:10pt; margin-bottom:3pt; page-break-after:avoid;=
 font-size:15pt">
				<span style=3D"color:#1f3a5f">Autumn Harvest is back</span>
			</h1>
			<p style=3D"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:6pt">
				<img src=3D"image.003.jpeg" width=3D"640" height=3D"400" alt=3D"" />
			</p>
			<p style=3D"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:6pt">
				<span>The spiced roast, apple butter, cranberry relish, squash soup and=
 fruit loaf are in stock until the end of December. Last year the range sol=
d out twice: order early.</span>
			</p>
			<h1 style=3D"margin-top:10pt; margin-bottom:3pt; page-break-after:avoid;=
 font-size:15pt">
				<span style=3D"color:#1f3a5f">Order online</span>
			</h1>
			<p style=3D"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:6pt">
				<span>Re-order from your phone at </span><a href=3D"https://www.harborl=
ane.example/order" style=3D"text-decoration:none"><span style=3D"text-decor=
ation:underline; color:#2e8b7a">www.harborlane.example/order</span></a><spa=
n>, or reply to this newsletter.</span>
			</p>
			<p style=3D"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:6pt; font-size:8pt">
				<span style=3D"color:#5e6b78">Harbor Lane Provisions, 18 Quayside Road,=
 Port Ellery. You receive this newsletter as a wholesale customer.</span>
			</p>
